      "date": "2026-05-06T11:25:15.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹287 (vs ₹219 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹287 (up from ₹219 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹474.1b (up 16% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹57.4b (up 31% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 12% (up from 11% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 6.9% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 8.7% growth forecast for the Auto industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 23% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 26% per year.",
