      "date": "2026-01-27T19:28:00.000Z",
      "title": "Hero MotoCorp Ltd Appoints Shivalika Chadha Malik as Head of Communications - External and Internal",
      "body": "Hero MotoCorp Ltd. has appointed Shivalika Chadha Malik as Head of Communications - External and Internal, overseeing both India and global markets. In her new role, Malik will lead the company's communications strategy at a time when the world's largest manufacturer of motorcycles and scooters continues to evolve its global presence and purpose-led initiatives. Prior to joining Hero MotoCorp, Malik spent six years at PepsiCo, where she last served as Associate Director - Brand Communications for the AMESA region (Africa, Middle East and South Asia). She began her journey at PepsiCo as Senior Manager - Communications for PepsiCo India and went on to take on expanded regional responsibilities. Earlier in her career, Malik has worked with leading communications firms including Avian Media an",
